\section{SUMMARY}
Python Backend Engineer with 3 years of experience building REST APIs and backend services with
Django and FastAPI. Most recently built RBI Account Aggregator systems for NBFC lenders,
including a bank statement analyzer where a parser redesign cut Gemini API cost by 97\%. Author
of two FastAPI libraries on PyPI and a contributor to SQLAlchemy.

\section{SKILLS}
\textbf{Languages:} Python, SQL, JavaScript, C/C++, Bash\par
\textbf{Backend:} FastAPI, Django, Django REST Framework, Flask, Node.js, Celery, RabbitMQ\par
\textbf{Generative AI and ML:} LLMs (Gemini API, Ollama), OCR, pandas, NumPy\par
\textbf{Data:} PostgreSQL, MySQL, MongoDB, Redis, SQLAlchemy, Alembic\par
\textbf{Cloud and DevOps:} AWS (EC2, S3, RDS), Docker, GitHub Actions, Jenkins, Nginx, pytest, ruff, mypy\par
\textbf{Fintech:} RBI Account Aggregator, consent management, FIU/FIP and TSP integration, bank
statement analysis\par

\section{EXPERIENCE}
\entry{Software Engineer \textbar{} SurePass Technologies Pvt. Ltd., Delhi}{May 2026 -- Nov 2026}
\textbf{Product:} finpass.ai, SurePass's Account Aggregator business, which delivers customer
financial data to NBFC lenders
\begin{itemize}
  \item Cut the Gemini API cost of the bank statement analyzer (BSA) by 97\%, from about INR 1.48
    lakh to INR 5,000 a month, by redesigning bank detection in its statement parser
  \item Reworked the BSA pipeline and queries for faster processing; statements are parsed with a
    self-hosted LLM on Ollama
  \item Developed the AA consent management system (creation, approval, revocation, expiry) in
    line with the RBI AA framework
  \item Built a multi-AA data vault that stores and serves financial information received from
    multiple aggregators
  \item Integrated multiple AAs and TSPs behind one interface with failover, so lenders still
    receive data if a provider fails
\end{itemize}
\gap
\entry{Python Backend Developer \textbar{} In2IT Technologies Pvt. Ltd., Noida}{Apr 2024 -- Apr 2026}
\textbf{Products:} iProvision, iDashboard, ProWatch
\begin{itemize}
  \item Developed REST APIs for iProvision, a network inventory and device management platform
    serving 10,000+ concurrent users, with device operations over SNMP and NETCONF/RESTCONF;
    helped cut network downtime by 40\%
  \item Built backend services for ProWatch, an employee performance monitoring and system
    management platform, including AI OCR that classifies screenshots of employee screens by
    active application and capture time
  \item Cut API latency by 69\% (800 to 250 ms) and tripled capacity with Redis caching, Celery
