  \item Developed backend services for iDashboard, a custom dashboard and chart builder
  \item Built CI/CD (Docker, GitHub Actions, Jenkins) at 85\%+ test coverage: 35\% fewer production
    bugs, 60\% faster deploys
\end{itemize}
